title Vinyl: the output muted at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm) (the volume group in the bottom row: the level box's muted look with the speaker-off mark alone, large: the owner's deck report of 2026-11-13); "-" does nothing, "+" brings the sound back at its level (allow-small: the rows under 7 mm are warnings)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm, the harness's default for 640x480): the approved layout's touch rows are 70 px
# there, under the 7 mm (79 px): allow-small reports them as warnings (the owner's rule R-4) instead of failing
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_MUTED 1

wait 1200
shot 01-now-muted
expect esc
expect notext "60"
# the mark alone (24 px or more, drawn about 60 % of the box high: the app stops a scene that breaks it); never a word
expect notext "Mute"
expect notext "Muted"
expect notext "Off"
wait 300
shot 02-now-muted-volume
# "-" while muted does nothing
tapxy 0.720 0.912
wait 300
expect notext "Mute"
expect notext "60"
# "+" brings the sound back at its level
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 03-now-unmuted
expect notext "Mute"
expect text "60"
expect noquit
